  "shortDesc": "Located within 1 km radius of Railway Station, 7 km radius from Nagpur Airport and Krishnum South Indian Restaurant, Hotel Shree ",
  "longDesc": "<p>Located within 1 km radius of Railway Station, 7 km radius from Nagpur Airport and Krishnum South Indian Restaurant, Hotel Shree Vaibhav houses conference rooms and banquet halls.</p>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Hotel Shree Vaibhav, located in the heart of the city, is a 3 star accommodation that offers 47 spacious rooms, divided as Single Room AC, Double Room AC, Deluxe Room AC, Super Deluxe AC, Super Deluxe Suite AC, Deluxe Room Double and Deluxe Room Single. Located near this hotel are many tourist attractions of the city, such as Sitalbudi Fort, Deekshabhoomi, Jama Masjid, Ambazari Lake and Maharajbaug Zoo.</p>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Ideal for leisure travellers, this accommodation provides other facilities, such as doctor-on-call, laundry and car rental. In addition, there are conference rooms and banquet halls within the premises for meetings, seminars and parties.</p>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Guests can head to the nearby Krishnum South Indian Restaurant to relish south Indian delicacies. Also, they can visit other nearby restaurants and food joints.</p>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Visit Sitalbudi Fort, one of the historical landmarks of the city, while staying at the hotel.</p>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Electric kettle available on demand. Smoking as well as Non-Smoking Rooms available. Each room is equipped with a TV set.</p>\r\n",
